ild login) and \\\"Untuk Orang Tua/Guru\\\" → `/akun/daftar`. Header nav with Logo + links (`#cara-belajar`, `#bibi`, `#orang-tua`) + \\\"Masuk\\\" button for adults → `/akun/masuk`.\\n   - FR-LP-02 \\\"Cara Belajar\\\" section (id `cara-belajar`): 3 level cards with icon + hover animation. Import `LEVELS` from `@/content/missions` (fields: level, concept, title, subtitle, emoji, color) and mention curriculum ties (Level 1 Sequencing: siklus air, tumbuh kembang tanaman, penjumlahan bersusun; Level 2 Looping: perkalian sbg penjumlahan berulang, pola bilangan, detak jantung, fase bulan; Level 3 IF-ELSE: genap/ganjil, terapung/tenggelam, herbivora/karnivora).\\n   - FR-LP-03 \\\"Kenalan dengan Bibi AI\\\" (id `bibi`): interactive demo — a client component that plays a short static chat conversation (e.g. child: \\\"Kenapa looping-ku nggak jalan?\\\" Bibi: \\\"Bayangkan kamu menyiram 5 pot bunga...\\\") with typing animation, plus 2–3 tappable quick-question chips that reveal different canned Bibi replies. Explain tiered hints (Tingkat 1 pertanyaan pemandu, 2 analogi, 3 petunjuk spesifik) and that Bibi never gives the full answer.\\n   - FR-LP-04 Parents/teachers section (id `orang-tua`): a static mock/preview of the dashboard built with HTML/Tailwind (summary stats, concept mastery chips \\\"Sudah Paham / Sedang Belajar / Perlu Bantuan\\\", mini bar chart), plus safety guarantees (no child email/personal data, parental cons\n<truncated 10036 bytes>","toolAction":"\"Launching parallel builders\"","toolSummary":"\"Parallel subagents\""}}],"truncated_fields":["tool_calls"]}
